                <divLine xml:id="m-90c6d7b1-321b-4d14-a675-b1b3b6d18229" facs="#m-0bf07015-8e14-4bce-9edc-e3a75f67c715" form="finalis" />
              </layer>
            </staff>
            <div xml:id="m-cb7abb7d-4d07-4b3c-a2de-0cb1b657e017">
              <lg xml:id="m-ec715790-3bf9-44b6-a82d-a7e64c2e2d1a">
                <l xml:id="m-3723fea7-8b38-4986-9f0a-7680b8b619c5" facs="#m-a30af68f-8378-46ba-913f-54adad202dac" label="ambiguous">Laetatus sum. 4.E, A. Az.</l><l xml:id="m-25f02660-de94-49f5-b4e7-f8b790781c34" facs="#m-1f0181e3-14de-4499-a32d-d68b5013719d" label="ambiguous">171</l><l xml:id="m-ca17317c-789c-4d3c-9f27-bd537a48ca67" facs="#m-c409dc56-c189-4e5b-a4f3-a6a539a6b4d7" label="lyrics-like">2. Stántes érant pédes nóstri, * in átriis túis Jerúsalem.</l><l xml:id="m-7f1cba33-93c5-4a10-81a0-bfd6812e6813" facs="#m-b90fc3e3-b437-4fe6-a124-445a464736d7" label="lyrics-like">3. Jerúsalem, quae aedifieátur ut eivitas:* cújus participátio éjus in</l><l xml:id="m-19814bde-cae5-4d25-9952-8d8a7f1b9486" facs="#m-89752ab2-3219-4b6e-a44b-7c7d419669c8" label="ambiguous">"aipsum.</l><l xml:id="m-d76a2de8-9e51-4951-b3ea-d2d19c962038" facs="#m-4cae45d6-d683-4185-a59e-1bbd8600b853" label="lyrics-like">4. Illuc enim ascendérunt tribus, tribus Dómini :* testimónium Israel</l><l xml:id="m-b02610c0-e2c3-4134-afd6-6a455ac1b855" facs="#m-cb5d1472-8ab6-4832-8d1e-d62dd8829e97" label="lyrics-like">ad confiténdum nómini Dómini.</l><l xml:id="m-5cb79967-23e4-4d0b-b5e9-6819f7805d49" facs="#m-2ee6d9aa-4dc5-4459-a47d-ab76aa3185ec" label="lyrics-like">4. Quia illic sedérunt sédes in judicio, * sédes super dómum Dávid.</l><l xml:id="m-4f7f7875-fce3-4bb4-bf73-951af964030f" facs="#m-da85a08f-dc21-4c6d-a066-519fddb6d84b" label="lyrics-like">6. Rogâte quae ad pácem súnt Jerúsalem :“ et abundántia diligén¬</l><l xml:id="m-712b64e9-b0bc-4ef9-9473-cb33115f6098" facs="#m-158d14ef-77d7-42a7-b72c-4ada023d688c" label="ambiguous">tibus te.</l><l xml:id="m-5eab93d3-7e7e-4ffb-a337-dbb8f2d719d9" facs="#m-17ece9d2-b2b7-412c-bc91-8fb03aaa3f23" label="lyrics-like">7. Fíat pax in virtûte túa:“et abundántia in túrribus túis.</l><l xml:id="m-e8c4715f-5e0c-420d-890f-8e10f6b92911" facs="#m-86bb2d72-d90e-407b-9016-205181359609" label="lyrics-like">8. Propter frâtres méos et próximos méos:“loquébar pácem de te:</l><l xml:id="m-aa725506-2b62-4d84-886d-d8d508cfa4ee" facs="#m-60d530ab-161a-4662-84b1-3e318e313ea9" label="lyrics-like">9. Propter dómum Dómini Déi nóstri, * quaesivi bóna tibi.</l><l xml:id="m-e9f4b79d-a00d-4e91-bcc8-5a1705325446" facs="#m-bdb922de-2302-46eb-87b2-0ea7541818ae" label="lyrics-like">10. Glória Pâtri, et Fillo, et Spiritui Sáncto.</l><l xml:id="m-9d19846b-b66c-48e5-8f8c-871179ab5f60" facs="#m-8a73f705-664b-4b5c-bc84-5d3e45a07d08" label="lyrics-like">11. Sicut érat in princípio, et núne, et sémper, * et in saécula saecu¬</l><l xml:id="m-622c7cf0-6d0a-47b3-8a9d-4362eab1833f" facs="#m-f9a4a72b-599c-4ac7-a3bb-8dc84f678d40" label="ambiguous">lorum. Amen.</l><l xml:id="m-c0ba15af-1e85-4ed3-bddd-e6c4b9c3ebff" facs="#m-c35b3dfa-c25b-438e-a11a-10e75e95ef98" label="text-like">Tone 4. E, A, At.</l><l xml:id="m-ac34089d-bf06-4d31-b287-d2f08fe173ab" facs="#m-d3e8be2c-6243-412f-af6d-56dded0a406f" label="text-like">Mediant of I accent with 2 preparatory Endings of i accent with a prepara¬</l><l xml:id="m-ff376a6d-f9fe-41fe-8e94-bed4a1c6b229" facs="#m-42b60a1d-cfa3-4a84-a159-693e081ae45c" label="ambiguous">sllables</l><l xml:id="m-e49b86a3-e46a-4c4e-8b03-d2a530e653e6" facs="#m-ebb9c3ab-7227-488b-9bf0-ba3cffe933ab" label="lyrics-like">tory syllables (For the ending É, an</l><l xml:id="m-3d628f62-9571-40fc-8398-2f99765b1d24" facs="#m-d02ddbd2-8374-451d-aa95-70c129f6803e" label="text-like">extra note is added in anticipation &amp;</l><l xml:id="m-464cb654-0999-4ba4-883e-3a36e5ae0e89" facs="#m-da16768a-e551-43e4-8f38-278c7cba61d7" label="text-like">the accent in dactylic cadences).</l><l xml:id="m-04fc34df-5bd9-4307-b767-6998032e9f41" facs="#m-b05b34d6-5096-4d3c-ae3f-8e54d470e1d1" label="lyrics-like">1. Laetátus sum in his quae dícta sunt mi¬ hi:*In dómum Dómi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-be56709b-fc0a-4036-9375-ffbb9f3a9a4e" facs="#m-c6e873e0-3f4a-4e8e-8249-9a2d86a0a238" label="ambiguous">—E</l><l xml:id="m-dea02cce-667d-476a-b31d-3c18ab94b39f" facs="#m-80a0315c-cb82-44e3-95e7-b911ed79901e" label="ambiguous">i-bimus.</l><l xml:id="m-435d999d-4e59-4406-bddc-6a165a51590b" facs="#m-f79d0d4b-c7b5-4ea8-a032-c879447470e6" label="lyrics-like">1. Laetátus sum in his quae dicta sunt mi- hi:*In dómum Dómi-ni</l><l xml:id="m-2f637edc-8e53-4099-8ca9-eaf357c939b8" facs="#m-115fecf7-221c-40ed-9802-b046fd1c00d3" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-e1efbd28-050d-427d-8739-c0ec5b020c0e" facs="#m-cf4376e0-f88c-4821-905d-7205f25d5147" label="ambiguous">A</l><l xml:id="m-87841605-c0fb-463b-b421-3ed608a995bb" facs="#m-bfd4a09d-9d13-49b6-a43c-11cabe0d5f28" label="ambiguous">i-bimus. or:ibimus.</l><l xml:id="m-71897dd3-e800-4648-abf3-314bbd4e312a" facs="#m-d529977a-dd87-47af-9001-63d2315e0b59" label="lyrics-like">2. Stántes érant pédes nóstri, *in átriis tuis Jerúsalem. (E: Jerú¬</l><l xml:id="m-21ffc0c2-9f86-4f96-8875-ea8d84046750" facs="#m-05b71caf-45d0-44db-9855-9ae8a5731fc8" label="ambiguous">salem.)</l><l xml:id="m-09ab258a-4c59-4455-8d72-caf806277336" facs="#m-462ad5bb-895e-4b5c-9460-e6af890eb4d8" label="lyrics-like">3. Jerúsalem, quae aedificátur ut civitas: *cújus participátio élus in</l><l xml:id="m-91ab5f07-9f9e-4f2c-9c07-8ccea34988a4" facs="#m-8bef1697-50e6-4f00-9316-a9f337a73491" label="ambiguous">mipsum.</l><l xml:id="m-9695b151-323f-4d8e-b66f-78476d271384" facs="#m-d65adc08-6f1b-4fd5-b322-e359cbaaf3bb" label="lyrics-like">4. Illuc enim ascendérunt tribus, tribus Dómini :* testimónium Israel</l><l xml:id="m-5d337087-a0e4-4c7e-8549-a23d19bbb55e" facs="#m-46b4a520-17f2-4dc0-9a70-dd021fd26d49" label="lyrics-like">ad confiténdum nómini Dómini. (E: Dómini.)</l><l xml:id="m-64367edb-af3b-4e3b-bb23-0ca63d034fd2" facs="#m-14ee4897-35a6-4871-8fc9-7a970dcf3fb8" label="lyrics-like">5. Quia illic sedérunt sédes tn Judicio, *sédes super dómum Dávid.</l></lg>
            </div>
          </section>
        </score>
      </mdiv>
    </body>
  </music>
